        "trigger": "A creature uses a hostile action against an illusory figure created by the Trial of Tolerance or fails at an attempt to disable the trap; Effect The illusory figure effortlessly avoids the triggering action, then appears to attack the triggering creature using its most harrowing and violent option. Regardless of what this attack appears as, the triggering creature takes 3d12+19 mental damage (DC 38 basic Reflex save).",
