    "complexity": "Complex",
    "description": "A convincing illusion of a bustling market scene fills the empty room, confronting the viewers with potentially frightening diversity and unexpected encounters.",
    "disable": "DC 43 Thievery (master) to scratch out well-hidden key runes etched into the room\u2019s floor, or *dispel magic* (9th rank; counteract DC 36) to counteract the trial",
